o.uk/news/480/cpsprodpb/8d37/live/67a7cd10-a2fa-11f1-8d5b-155abe464768.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"CCTV shows people running as mud and water destroys buildings in Gyirong, Tibet\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"/></div></div></div><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Grid-styles__GridStyled-sc-772acff9-0 kYsqtw\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleGravityWrapper-sc-c7d910a6-1 dWFLGi\"><div class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__TitleWrapperStyled-sc-c7d910a6-0 hEhfIe\"><h2 data-testid=\"card-headline\" class=\"IndexCardHeading-styles__CardHeadlineStyled-sc-c7d910a6-3 dyeGOh\">Footage of Tibet floods isn&#x27;t being shown in China - and we know little about victims there</h2></div></div><p data-testid=\"card-description\" class=\"Dundee-styles__DescriptionStyled-sc-50abbc98-0 eUixcX\">Some of the most dramatic footage from the deadly flash flooding is hidden from public view in China.</p><div class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetadataStyled-sc-10966952-0 fIfKvi\"><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-lastupdated\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataDateStyled-sc-10966952-1 feNzEJ\">4 hrs ago</span><div data-testid=\"card-metadata-separator\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__Separator-sc-10966952-3 decXPj\"></div><span data-testid=\"card-metadata-tag\" class=\"IndexCardMetadata-styles__MetaDataTagStyled-sc-10966952-2 ewmvhB\">Asia</span></div></div></div></a></div></div></div><div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 igNVuU\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-card\" data-indexcard=\"true\" class=\"IndexCard-styles__IndexCardStyled-sc-3a0d8802-0 jeApUG\"><div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\"><a href=\"/news/articles/cn45vdxyvvlo\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Anchor-styles__AnchorStyled-sc-651d33db-0 hygVWX\"><div data-testid=\"manchester-article\" class=\"Manchester-styles__CardStyled-sc-5c1d085b-1 cGPaOi\"><div data-testid=\"card-text-wrapper\" class=\"Manchester-styles__TextWrapperStyled-sc-